{"synopsis":"Kim Sangan adalah seorang lintah darat berdarah dingin.\nKetika adiknya yang merupakan seorang guru bunuh diri setelah disiksa bertubi-tubi oleh muridnya…\nDia menjadi wali kelas baru mereka untuk menagih “utang” nyawa adiknya.\nSeorang rentenir yang rela merangkak ke dasar neraka demi menagih utang, dan murid-murid yang tidak kalah dari iblis.\nHubungan “guru dan murid” yang brutal, dimulai.","alternative_title":"사채지간","author":"Black and White","artist":"Kim Dong Chan","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"9382f226-8b78-46e9-86cf-a8f08824c164","number":"36","chapter":"36","title":"","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5286959-2922-4bd7-bbd4-11f873c7c255/chapter_ch_36/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5286959-2922-4bd7-bbd4-11f873c7c255/chapter_ch_36/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5286959-2922-4bd7-bbd4-11f873c7c255/chapter_ch_36/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5286959-2922-4bd7-bbd4-11f873c7c255/chapter_ch_36/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5286959-2922-4bd7-bbd4-11f873c7c255/chapter_ch_36/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5286959-2922-4bd7-bbd4-11f873c7c255/chapter_ch_36/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5286959-2922-4bd7-bbd4-11f873c7c255/chapter_ch_36/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5286959-2922-4bd7-bbd4-11f873c7c255/chapter_ch_36/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5286959-2922-4bd7-bbd4-11f873c7c255/chapter_ch_36/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5286959-2922-4bd7-bbd4-11f873c7c255/chapter_ch_36/10.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5286959-2922-4bd7-bbd4-11f873c7c255/chapter_ch_36/11.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_d5286959-2922-4bd7-bbd4-11f873c7c255/chapter_ch_36/12.webp"]},{"chapter_id":"63aeeb18-6e79-4881-b57d-b89a0afd6348","number":"35","chapter":"35","title":"","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01","images":["https://assets.shngm.id